        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 294f2b42-21ff-4a98-925c-2752faeb24b1).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47. The target today,  Ryan Fulton, is stationed at the Global Innovation Race in Miami. Fulton, a full time security guard for public events, recently entered a low-level street gang, taking bribes in order to allow them access to restricted areas. Causing untold damage and losses, this cannot be allowed to continue. Fulton should be situated near the main entrance, but entering with a disguise elsewhere may present different opportunities. I will leave you to prepare.",
